<title>USA: Central Parking Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>Central Parking Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		   $  55,924,000	$ 35,680,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			   4,416,000	   3,465,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		    0.25		  0.20</p>
<p>Sales of property and equipment:</p>
<p>   Net gain after taxes		   1,000	     742,000</p>
<p>   Net gain after taxes per share     $	     -</p>
<p>									   0.04</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares  17,604,000	  17,523,000</p>
<p>					    Six Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		   $  97,348,000	$ 68,931,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			   8,315,000	   6,693,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		    0.47		  0.39</p>
<p>Sales of property and equipment:</p>
<p>   Net gain after taxes		   3,000	     769,000</p>
<p>   Net gain after taxes per share     $	     -</p>
<p>									   0.04</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares  17,609,000	  17,374,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Central Parking Corp said its second quarter period ended March 31.</p>
<p>Net income for the second quarter of 1997 included a gain of $742,000, or $0.04 per share, from the sale of property.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1997 included a gain of $769,000, or $0.04 per share, from the sale of property.</p>
</text>
